    {
      "type": "Block",
      "value": "---\nesid: sec-Intl.Locale.prototype.getNumberingSystems\ndescription: >\n  Language subtags with more than three letters are supported.\ninfo: |\n  NumberingSystemsOfLocale ( loc )\n  1. If loc.[[NumberingSystem]] is not undefined, then\n    a. Return CreateArrayFromList(« loc.[[NumberingSystem]] »).\n  2. Let match be LookupMatchingLocaleByPrefix(%Intl.NumberFormat%.[[AvailableLocales]], « loc.[[Locale]] »).\n  3. If match is not undefined, then\n    ...\n  4. Else,\n    a. Let list be « \"latn\" ».\n  5. Return CreateArrayFromList(list).\n\nfeatures: [Intl.Locale, Intl.Locale-info]\n---",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 708
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " \"abcdefgh\" is not a registered language, so it always returns the default",
      "start": 710,
      "end": 786
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " numbering system \"latn\".",
      "start": 787,
      "end": 814
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Except if an explicit \"nu\" Unicode extension subtag is present.",
      "start": 932,
      "end": 998
    }
